DESCRIPTION:Meet at 10 AM. New starting location to be announced. The Loop 
 will not be our starting point this year. Saturday\, December 5\, 2026 at 
 10 AM remains confirmed. Ride departure time will be announced when the sc
 hedule is settled. Dress festive and bring a new\, unwrapped toy for kids 
 in need. Come alone or bring a friend. The brewery-to-brewery ride continu
 es through the afternoon. Brewery stops and the final brewery will be anno
 unced closer to ride day. The calendar blocks time through 5:30 PM as an e
 stimate; the actual finish time may vary.\n\nWebsite and ride updates: htt
 ps://scrmsp.org\n\nFacebook RSVP (optional but appreciated): https://www.f
 acebook.com/events/1972798296683555/\n\nThe ride is free and no registrati
 on is required. Ride at your own risk and follow traffic laws. If you’re
  drinking, arrange a sober driver.
